<title>TURKEY: Turkish troops kill over 30 rebel Kurds-agency.</title>
<headline>Turkish troops kill over 30 rebel Kurds-agency.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish troops have killed more than 30 separatist Kurds in fighting in northern Iraq during a two-day-old assault against the rebel Kurdistan Workers Party (PKK), the state-run Anatolian news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Anatolian said troops had inflicted their first casualties in clashes in Sarisavaklar region across the border from the Turkish province of Sirnak. It said fighting was continuing.</p>
</text>
